<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech brewer Radegast H1 gross CZK158.6mln.</title>
<headline>Czech brewer Radegast H1 gross CZK158.6mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second largest Czech brewer, Radegast a.s. said on Thursday that its first half 1997 gross profits had fallen to 158.6 million crowns from 179.6 in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Results for six month period ending June 30, 1997 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>				   H1 1997	    H1 1996</p>
<p> Gross profit		  158.620	    179.600</p>
<p> Operating profit	    184.585	    203.351</p>
<p> Depreciation		   98.319	     90.299</p>
<p> Production		    825.258	    749.444</p>
<p> Assets			4,088.581	  2,936.838</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
